" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Noto Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.0" font-weight="800" font-style="normal" fill="#1b5e5d" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.7" data-text-class="body" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">EXACT RETRY</text><text x="190" y="609" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace" font-size="12.0" font-weight="700" font-style="normal" fill="#2c3e50" text-anchor="start" data-text-class="technical" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">R_exact(u,uᵣ) ⇔ c = cᵣ ∧ b = bᵣ ∧ k = kᵣ ∧ o = oᵣ</text><text x="48" y="643" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Noto Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.0" font-weight="800" font-style="normal" fill="#6b4a00" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.7" data-text-class="body" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">SYMBOLS</text><text x="190" y="643" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace" font-size="12.0" font-weight="700" font-style="normal" fill="#2c3e50" text-anchor="start" data-text-class="technical" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">u submitted operation · uᵣ retained operation · c coordinate · b request bytes · k context bytes · o ordinal</text><text x="48" y="677" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Noto Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.0" font-weight="800" font-style="normal" fill="#6b4a00" text-anchor="start" letter-spacing="0.7" data-text-class="body" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">NO REUSE</text><text x="190" y="677" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace" font-size="12.0" font-weight="700" font-style="normal" fill="#2c3e50" text-anchor="start" data-text-class="technical" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">o_high = 0 initially  ·  o_next = checked_add(o_high, 1)  ·  overflow ⇒ seal epoch</text