ricPrecision">UNITS</text><text x="134" y="672" font-family="ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace" font-size="12.0" font-weight="700" font-style="normal" fill="#2c3e50" text-anchor="start" data-text-class="technical" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">T,U receiver-clock duration · A allocations · C full-payload copies · M portable bytes · J local charge</text><text x="48" y="702" font-family="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Noto Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13.0" font-weight="500" font-style="italic" fill="#4c545a" text-anchor="start" data-text-class="body" text-rendering="geometricPrecision">BOUNDARY · B03 selects finite profiles with checked arithmetic. Compatibility JSON may allocate. These are targets, not measurements.</text></svg>
